    "title": "Low Temperature Halide Assisted HVPE Growth of Single Crystal AlN Films",
    "authors": "K. Udwary; M. Smeaton; J. S. Mangum; R. Gannon; G. Dodson; B. Tellekamp; K. L. Schulte; J. H. Leach; J. Simon",
