    "title": "Nonlinear Hall Effect in Altermagnetic Warped Topological Insulators",
    "authors": "Debashree Chowdhury",
    "institutions": "Centre for Nanotechnology, IIT Roorkee",
    "journal": "arXiv:2609.17001 v1",
    "material": "六角翘曲TI/d波交错磁体界面",
    "method": "连续模型与量子几何响应计算",
    "category": "磁性、拓扑与自旋",
