    "id": "doi:10.1103/6bxt-c4zm",
    "title": "NMR evidence of pressure-induced structural transition and enhanced spin fluctuations up to 14 GPa in SrCu₂(BO₃)₂",
    "authors": "Zhanlong Wu; Kefan Du; Shuo Li; Tong Shi; Ying Chen; Qingxin Dong; Rui Zhou; Rong Yu; Juanjuan Liu; Bosen Wang; Jinguang Cheng; Weiqiang Yu; Yi Cui",
