    "id": "doi:10.1103/skmb-x53v",
    "title": "Pressure-induced superconductivity in CdPSe₃",
    "authors": "Xu Liu; Boqin Song; Jian-gang Guo; Tianping Ying",
    "institutions": "中国科学院物理研究所（作者单位待正式全文进一步核对）",
    "journal": "Physical Review B（Accepted Paper）",
    "material": "CdPSe₃",
    "method": "高压电输运与低温结构测量；母晶生长未核查",
    "category": "高温与非常规超导",
