    "id": "doi:10.1038/s41467-026-77618-6",
    "title": "Berry curvature multipoles in Kagome superconductor CsV₃Sb₅",
    "authors": "Shanshan Liu; Prasun Boyal; Enze Zhang; Qifeng Hu; Xu Han; Kian Ping Loh",
    "institutions": "作者单位：出版社提前版本尚未完整呈现，本次未核查",
