    "id": "doi:10.1021/acs.nanolett.6c02634",
    "title": "Emergent Circularly Polarized Luminescence from Self-Assembled Chiral-Ligand-Functionalized CsPbBr₃ Nanocrystals",
    "authors": "Prasenjit Mandal; Mohit Chaudhary; Jeanne Cloarec; Oleg V. Prezhdo; Dmitry Baranov",
    "institutions": "Lund University；University of New Mexico；Université PSL",
    "journal": "Nano Letters",
    "material": "CsPbBr₃纳米晶",
    "method": "手性配体功能化纳米晶自组装；具体合成参数未核查",
