    "title": "Magnetic and Crystal Electric Field Studies of a Spin-Orbit Coupled Hyperkagome Compound Yb₃Ga₂Al₃O₁₂",
    "authors": "R. Kolay; S. Samanta; Sangeeta; M. P. Saravanan; R. Nath",
