    "title": "Evidence of Crystal-Field-Mediated Anisotropic Orbital Rashba Effect in Epitaxial Ru/FM Heterostructure",
    "authors": "Yu Zhang; Wenhao Niu; Yumin Yang; Wenqi Xu; Gengchen Meng; Hailong Wang; Na Lei; Dahai Wei",
    "institutions": "",
    "journal": "arXiv:2609.04642v1 (Mesoscale and Nanoscale Physics (cond-mat.mes-hall) ; Materials Science (cond-mat.mtrl-sci))",
    "material": "外延 Ru/Ni、Ru/Co、Ru/CoFeB",
    "method": "磁控溅射外延 + 二次谐波 Hall",
